{"3774370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pixelorbit", "steam_appid": 3774370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 <strong>BUILD YOUR OWN COMBAT SHIP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command in Pixelorbit, a Space ARPG about loot, progression and building your own combat ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hostile sectors, collect powerful items, explore an MMO-inspired galaxy and shape your ship through Extras, Mods and Passives. Instead of following a fixed upgrade path, you create your own playstyle — stacking effects, modifying your weapons and turning upgrades into powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small. Find better loot. Modify your ship. Push deeper into dangerous space. Then watch your build escalate into an explosive endgame machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>FIGHT &amp; LOOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/7dc3cc8c3cc7e0b5d56fbb1004d33deb.poster.avif?t=1781247849\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/7dc3cc8c3cc7e0b5d56fbb1004d33deb.webm?t=1781247849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/7dc3cc8c3cc7e0b5d56fbb1004d33deb.mp4?t=1781247849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced PvE space combat against enemy ships, elites, bosses and dangerous sector threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy enemies, collect loot and keep pushing your ship toward the next power spike. Every fight can bring new resources, stronger equipment or the next piece your build needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔧 <strong>DEEP ITEMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/3fb2004c0468d41e16529075010b05bd.poster.avif?t=1781247849\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/3fb2004c0468d41e16529075010b05bd.webm?t=1781247849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/3fb2004c0468d41e16529075010b05bd.mp4?t=1781247849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, compare and upgrade items across a large progression system with 500+ items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, generators, modules and equipment can shape your stats, strengthen your build and open new ways to progress. Pixelorbit is built around ARPG-inspired itemization, where loot is not just stronger — it can define how your ship plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 <strong>BUILD YOUR SHIP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/9ba11b65f4fa168b8d0b2e0f395de0a2.poster.avif?t=1781247849\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/9ba11b65f4fa168b8d0b2e0f395de0a2.webm?t=1781247849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/9ba11b65f4fa168b8d0b2e0f395de0a2.mp4?t=1781247849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your combat style through Extras, Mods and Passives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your projectiles, enhance your weapons, trigger new effects and combine multiple systems into powerful synergies. Your ship is not locked into one path — it evolves based on the choices you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪐 <strong>EXPLORE THE GALAXY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/b88425710f873ff7c7b1b5a5c23d5828.poster.avif?t=1781247849\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/b88425710f873ff7c7b1b5a5c23d5828.webm?t=1781247849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/b88425710f873ff7c7b1b5a5c23d5828.mp4?t=1781247849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through an MMO-inspired space world filled with sectors, quests, asteroid fields, resources and hidden opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine materials, discover new areas, complete quests and prepare your ship for increasingly dangerous encounters. The galaxy is built for long-term progression, exploration and steady growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💥 <strong>ESCALATE INTO ENDGAME POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/3b28e1ab6a409465379bbbcaecdaa412.poster.avif?t=1781247849\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/3b28e1ab6a409465379bbbcaecdaa412.webm?t=1781247849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774370/extras/3b28e1ab6a409465379bbbcaecdaa412.mp4?t=1781247849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The early and midgame give you time to grow your build step by step — but the late game is where Pixelorbit explodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergies become stronger, effects become bigger and your ship can evolve into a screen-filling endgame powerhouse filled with projectiles, explosions, loot and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 Space ARPG gameplay with loot-driven progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Fast-paced PvE spaceship combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠 Build your own combat ship through Extras, Mods and Passives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 500+ items to collect, upgrade and combine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪐 1000+ quests across an MMO-inspired galaxy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛏ Mining, crafting, exploration and long-term progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 Bosses, elites, sector threats and escalating challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Deep build-crafting without overwhelming complexity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 A slower early and midgame that grows into explosive endgame power</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 <strong>BUILD YOUR OWN COMBAT SHIP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command in Pixelorbit, a Space ARPG about loot, progression and building your own combat ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hostile sectors, collect powerful items, explore an MMO-inspired galaxy and shape your ship through Extras, Mods and Passives. Instead of following a fixed upgrade path, you create your own playstyle — stacking effects, modifying your weapons and turning upgrades into powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small. Find better loot. Modify your ship. Push deeper into dangerous space. Then watch your build escalate into an explosive endgame machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\